description: We give grants to churches to mend what has gone quiet — bells and their towers, pipe organs, rose windows, and the craftspeople who keep them.
---
<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--hero">
    <div class="stack stack--start">
      <span class="eyebrow">Grants for bells, organs and sacred arts</span>
      <h1 class="display display--lg">Let them ring<br><em>again</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="max-width: 42ch;">We give grants to churches to mend what has gone quiet — bells and their towers, pipe organs, rose windows, and the craftspeople who keep them.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--lg" href="{{ '/apply/' | url }}">Apply for a grant</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ '/story/' | url }}">Read our story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="figure">
      <div class="figure__frame">
        <img src="{{ '/uploads/IMG_8851.JPG' | url }}" alt="Looking up at the great bell in a stone ringing chamber, smaller bells hanging in the arched openings around it" width="2160" height="1207">
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">What we fund</span>
      <h2>Bells, organs, glass, and the hands that keep them</h2>
      <p class="lede">Grants support building and restoration, and the training of the artisans this work depends on. Amounts are set case by case.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid grid--3 mt-7">
      <div class="card card--accent card--interactive">
        <i class="ph ph-bell-simple icon icon--lg icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="card__title">Bells and towers</h3>
        <p class="muted mb-4">Repair, rehanging, new rings, frames and headstocks.</p>
        <span class="tag">Bells</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--accent card--interactive">
        <i class="ph ph-music-notes icon icon--lg icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="card__title">Pipe organs</h3>
        <p class="muted mb-4">Restoration, purchase, and the tuning that keeps them honest.</p>
        <span class="tag">Organs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--accent card--interactive">
        <i class="ph ph-church icon icon--lg icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3 class="card__title">Windows and glass</h3>
        <p class="muted mb-4">Rose windows, stained glass, leadwork and protective glazing.</p>
        <span class="tag">Glass</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--quote">
    <figure class="quote quote--lg">
      <blockquote>When I went to school in Europe, I loved hearing church bells ringing every 1/2 hour and on Sundays but I've not heard much church bells ringing in the States and thought it'd be neat to have them ringing again as Christian's "Call to Prayers."</blockquote>
      <figcaption>From the founding letter, February 2026</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="stack stack--sm stack--start">
      <p class="muted m0">A Florida 501(c)(3), founded February 2026. We fund projects across the United States, one at a time.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ '/guidelines/' | url }}">See the guidelines</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
